# Test Results Summary

## Overview

| **Tests 📝** | **Passed ✅** | **Failed ❌** | **Skipped ⏭️** | **Flaky 🍂** | **Duration ⏱️** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| {{ctrf.summary.tests}} | {{ctrf.summary.passed}} | {{ctrf.summary.failed}} | {{ctrf.summary.skipped}} | {{countFlaky ctrf.tests}} | {{formatDuration ctrf.summary.start ctrf.summary.stop}} |

## Execution Details
{{#if ctrf.summary.failed}}
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Failed Tests</th>
      <th>Browser</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{#each ctrf.tests}}
      {{#if (eq status "failed")}}
      <tr>
        <td>
          <details>
            <summary>{{getCtrfEmoji "failed"}} {{name}}</summary>
            <pre><code>{{#if message}}{{formatMessagePreCode message true}}{{else}}No message available{{/if}}</code></pre>
            <p><strong>Trace:</strong></p>
            <pre><code>{{#if trace}}{{formatMessagePreCode trace true}}{{attachments}}{{else}}No trace available{{/if}}</code></pre>
          </details>
        </td>
        <td>{{browser}}</td>
      </tr>
      {{/if}}
    {{/each}}
  </tbody>
</table>
{{else}}
<p>No failed tests ✨</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if (anyFailedTests ctrf.tests)}}
{{#if ctrf.extra.ai}}
### ✨ AI Test Analysis

{{ctrf.extra.ai}}
{{/if}}
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Failed Tests</th>
            <th>AI Analysis ✨</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
{{#each ctrf.tests ~}}
  {{~#if (eq status "failed") ~}}
        <tr>
            <td>{{getCtrfEmoji "failed"}} {{name}}</td>
            <td>{{#if ai}}{{~{formatMessage ai}}}{{else}}No AI summary available{{/if}}</td>
        </tr>
  {{~/if}}
{{~/each}}
    </tbody>
</table>
{{else}}
<p>No failed tests ✨</p>
{{/if}}

